527d1b\"><img src=\"https://link.axios.com/img/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94asy04h.8qv5/508dcaf8.gif\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\" /></a></td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-right:3.5%\" align=\"right\"> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL25ld3NsZXR0ZXJzL2F4aW9zLWZpbmlzaC1saW5lLWIzNTExMmNkLWI5YmMtNDUwOC1iNmM0LWQ5OTJiMjhhZjQ4MS5odG1sP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB4fb30299\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"b\" style=\"color:#222;font-size:13px;font-family:'gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-decoration:underline\">View in browser</a> </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"30\" style=\"height:30px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>  <tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.3\">  <span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.4px;color:#222;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">PRESENTED BY AMAZON </span>  </td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"16\" style=\"height:16px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1\">\r\n<span class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:44px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#008dc8;letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1\"> Axios Finish Line </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"text-align:center;line-height:1.5;padding-bottom:35px;padding-top:10px\">\r\n<span class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#222;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">By  Mike Allen and Erica Pandey and Jim VandeHei  <span style=\"margin:0 6px\">&middot;</span> Nov 25, 2026 </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;line-height:1.75;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;padding:0 3.5%\"><p><strong>🥧 Happy Thanksgiving Eve! </strong>Axios Nashville's Adam Tamburin is your host this evening, with a lesson on the joy of expressing gratitude — even when you're not expecting anything in return.</p><ul><li><em>Smart Brevity™ count: 394 words … 1½ mins. Copy edited by Amy Stern.</em></li></ul></td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  1 big thing: Write fan mail </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/2icSk5DrpnN0uCKzT1nsGzL38q0=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/11/26/1795658272261.jpg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/2icSk5DrpnN0uCKzT1nsGzL38q0=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/11/26/1795658272261.jpg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">Fans gather by a mural to pay respects to Dolly Parton in Knoxville, Tenn., after her death was announced in August. Photo: Megan Varner/Reuters</div><p><strong>When <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL2xvY2FsL25hc2h2aWxsZS8yMDI2LzA4LzI1L2RvbGx5LXBhcnRvbi1oYXMtZGllZC1hdC04MC1vYml0P3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB5417a9b9\" target=\"_blank\">Dolly Parton died</a></strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL2xvY2FsL25hc2h2aWxsZS8yMDI2LzA4LzI1L2RvbGx5LXBhcnRvbi1oYXMtZGllZC1hdC04MC1vYml0P3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aC5417a9b9\" target=\"_blank\"></a> in August, the sadness I felt didn't surprise me. What I didn't expect was the wave of regret that hit me next, <em>Axios Nashville's Adam Tamburin writes.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Flashback:</strong> I thought for years about thanking her for the ways her work enriched my life. But I stopped short of dropping a fan letter in the mail.</li><li><strong>In some ways</strong> it felt silly: How much could one person's note matter to her? She'd probably never even see it.</li></ul><p>🦋 <strong>But after she died, </strong>I realized how much sharing my gratitude would have mattered to me. I wish I had made the effort, regardless of the outcome.</p><ul><li><strong>So this fall, </strong>I decided to start making the effort and began sending fan mail for the first time in my life. It has been surprisingly fulfilling.</li></ul><p><strong>Following the science:</strong> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly9wbWMubmNiaS5ubG0ubmloLmdvdi9hcnRpY2xlcy9QTUMxMjI4MDg3Ny8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBdb15bde9\" target=\"_blank\">Studies have found</a> that expressing gratitude, particularly <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly9saW5rLnNwcmluZ2VyLmNvbS9hcnRpY2xlLzEwLjEwMDcvczQyNzYxLTAyMi0wMDE2MC0zP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB696e650e\" target=\"_blank\">through writing</a>, can improve our sense of well-being.</p><p><strong>💡 How I did it:</strong> I made a list of artists whose songs, shows and films have brought me joy.</p><ul><li><strong>Early entries included</strong> Barbra Streisand, Richard Carpenter (one half of the '70s singing duo the Carpenters), Tina Fey and Andrew Scott (the actor best known for playing the <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly9wZW9wbGUuY29tL2FuZHJldy1zY290dC1iZWVuLWNhbGxlZC13b3JzZS1uYW1lcy10aGFuLWZsZWFiYWctaG90LXByaWVzdC04NDE0MjYwP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBc18e3e59\" target=\"_blank\">\"hot priest\"</a> in \"Fleabag\").</li><li><strong>I bought a fresh pack </strong>of envelopes and a new sheet of stamps and got to work.</li></ul><p><strong>I've tried to</strong> send a letter every couple of weeks, usually to agents or management offices.</p><ul><li><strong>When I sit down</strong> to write, I think about the ways each artist has added color to my life. I reflect on the times they made me smile, laugh, cry or sing along. It's been a lovely way to spend my time.</li></ul><p><strong>💌 Reality check:</strong> I know my thank-you notes may never reach their intended recipients — and even if they do, the odds of getting any replies are very low.</p><ul><li><strong>But the process</strong> has been its own reward.</li></ul><p><em><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL2xvY2FsL25hc2h2aWxsZS8yMDI2LzExLzI1L2Zhbi1tYWlsLWdyYXRpdHVkZS10aGFuay15b3UtbGV0dGVycz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB7d87f2cb\" target=\"_blank\">Share this story</a> ... <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL3NpZ251cC9uYXNodmlsbGU_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBfebe65c0\" target=\"_blank\">Get Axios Nashville</a> ... <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL25ld3NsZXR0ZXJzL2xvY2FsP3V0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB1af8706a\" target=\"_blank\">Find your Axios Local city</a>.</em></p></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtYjM1MTEyY2QtYjliYy00NTA4LWI2YzQtZDk5MmIyOGFmNDgxLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QxJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkxJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNobGluZSZzdHJlYW09dG9w/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB2b7639f6\" style=\"display:inline-block\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-facebook-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.408065/aHR0cHM6Ly90d2l0dGVyLmNvbS9pbnRlbnQvdHdlZXQ_\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-x-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Tweet this Story\"></a> <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/48615713.\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-left:7px\"><img width=\"32\" height=\"32\" style=\"border:0\" src=\"https://static.axios.com/img/axios-site/newsletters/logos/footer/share-linkedin-circle-border.png\" alt=\"Post to LinkedIn\"></a>  <a href=\"mailto:?subject=From Axios: 1 big thing: Write fan mail&body=teruyuki%40hh.iij4u.or.jp%20has%20shared%20an%20Axios%20story%20with%20you%3A%0A%0A1 big thing: Write fan mail%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.axios.com%2Fnewsletters%2Faxios-finish-line-b35112cd-b9bc-4508-b6c4-d9